  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learning health systems: fostering participatory learning and action to equip rural health workers as change agents for maternal and newborn care.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRC JHSRI l aim is to understand if and how a participatory learning and action (PLA) intervention can improve organisational learning culture amongst rural health workers (HWs) and experiences of person-centred maternal and newborn health (MNH) care amongst women in rural South Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
